            <ArticleTitle>Novel fluoroprostacyclin analogs with modified cycloalkylenyl chains. Highly potent and orally active anti-anginal agents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>353-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Novel fluoroprostacyclin analogs (1a-f) have been synthesized and pharmacologically evaluated. Compounds 1a-c given intravenously or orally showed potent and long-lasting anti-anginal activities in an animal model.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
